-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A novel intraarterial chemotherapy using paclitaxel in albumin nanoparticles to treat advanced squamous cell carcinoma of the tongue: preliminary findings</article-title><source>Am J Roentgenol</source><year>2003</year><volume>181</volume><fpage>253</fpage><lpage>260</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Am J Roentgenol||181|253||bib4|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12818869</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Furutani</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fuwa</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kodaira</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsumoto</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamata</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tachibana</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Sakahara</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Continuous selective intraarterial chemotherapy in combination with irradiation for locally advanced cancer of the tongue and tongue base</article-title><source>Oral Oncol</source><year>2002</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>145</fpage><lpage>152</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Oral Oncol||38|145||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11854061</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fuwa</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsumoto</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamata</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kodaira</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Furutani</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Sasaoka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimura</surn